### Phase 2: Supabase Schema for Expense

Same project `fifuhkupaqcfjwyouwpa`. Migration creates 3 new tables:

**`expense_categories`** — default: Freelancer, Tool/License, Server Hosting, Tax, Salary, Equipment, Office Rent

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| id | uuid PK | gen_random_uuid() |
| name | text | Category name |
| color | text | Hex color |
| icon | text | Emoji |
| created_at | timestamptz | now() |

**`expense_expenses`** — main expense records

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| id | uuid PK | gen_random_uuid() |
| title | text | Description |
| amount | numeric | Amount |
| currency | text | USD/VND |
| expense_date | date | When it occurred |
| category_id | uuid FK | → expense_categories |
| project | text | Project name |
| client_name | text | Client (from shared invoice_clients) |
| vendor | text | Who was paid |
| payment_method | text | Cash/Transfer/Card |
| status | text | pending/approved/paid |
| notes | text | Notes |
| receipt_url | text | Receipt file URL |
| is_recurring | boolean | Recurring flag |
| recurring_frequency | text | monthly/quarterly/yearly |
| created_by | text | Username |
| created_at | timestamptz | now() |

**`expense_recurring`** — recurring expense templates

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| id | uuid PK | gen_random_uuid() |
| title | text | Template name |
| amount | numeric | Amount |
| currency | text | USD/VND |
| category_id | uuid FK | → expense_categories |
| project | text | Project |
| vendor | text | Payee |
| frequency | text | monthly/quarterly/yearly |
| next_run | date | Next date |
| is_active | boolean | Active flag |
| created_at | timestamptz | now() |

