### Phase 3: Expense Module — Components & Services

#### [NEW] `components/expense/ExpenseApp.tsx`
Main container, internal tab routing

#### [NEW] `components/expense/ExpenseList.tsx`
Table view + filters + monthly totals

#### [NEW] `components/expense/ExpenseForm.tsx`
Add/Edit expense form with all fields

#### [NEW] `components/expense/ExpenseCategoryManager.tsx`
Category CRUD with color/icon

#### [NEW] `components/expense/ExpenseRecurring.tsx`
Recurring expense template management

#### [NEW] `services/expenseService.ts`
Supabase CRUD for all expense_* tables

#### [NEW] `hooks/useExpenseState.ts`
State management (same pattern as useInvoiceState.ts)

#### [MODIFY] [types.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/types.ts)
Add: `ExpenseRecord`, `ExpenseCategory`, `RecurringExpense`, `AppConfig`

---

## Verification Plan

1. Login → Home Screen displays with app icons grid
2. Click Invoice → Invoice app loads (all existing features work)
3. Click ← Back → returns to Home Screen
4. Click Expense → Expense app loads
5. Add expense → saves to Supabase
6. Back to Home → smooth transition
